<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis sees 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Fortis sees 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch-Belgian financial group Fortis said on Thursday it saw net profit rising by 12-15 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>Earlier the firm said its net profit rose to 554 million ecus during the first nine months of 1996 from 469.0 million ecus in the same period of 1995.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +312 230 504 5000</p>
</text>
